    bitboard representing enemy pieces and add its value to the score, then we do the same for our pieces with the same set of 
    attack patterns. add it to our bitmap, 
    these bitmaps we use to erase captured pieces with an and not operation such that we dont need to copy the chess board. 
    do this until we dont find any pieces, this is going to be a a for loop with maybe 4 or 5 iterations max and some bitwise 
    operations.


